<Page title="Terms of Use" description="Terms of use for the ResultDosti website." updated="4 November 2026">
  <p>By using {site.domain} you agree to these terms.</p>
  <h2>Information only</h2>
  <p>ResultDosti provides information about government recruitment updates collected from official websites. It is provided for general information. While we take care to keep it accurate, mistakes or delays are possible, and official websites can change notices at any time. The official notification is always the final authority.</p>
  <h2>No official connection</h2>
  <p>ResultDosti is not a government website and is not connected to any government department, commission, board or other job portal. Names of exams and bodies are used only to identify the updates they published.</p>
  <h2>Your responsibility</h2>
  <p>Before applying, paying a fee or making any decision, confirm the details on the official website. Never pay any person or website that promises a job or a result.</p>
  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>We link to official and third party websites that we do not control, and are not responsible for their content or availability.</p>
  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>Do not misuse the website, attempt to disrupt it, or copy it in bulk with automated tools.</p>
  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>To the extent permitted by law, ResultDosti is not liable for any loss arising from the use of information on this website.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms. Continued use of the website means you accept the updated terms. Questions: {site.email}.</p>
</Page>
